{"strongs": "H1053", "word": "בֵּית שֶׁ֫מֶשׁ", "translit": "bet she.mesh", "root": "בטן", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, of a location", "gloss": "sun-temple", "definition": "בֵּית שֶׁ֫מֶשׁ proper name, of a location ( sun-temple ) — ׳ שׁ ׳ בּ Josh 19:22 + 8 t., ׳ שֿׁ ׳ בּ Josh 15:10 + 6 t.; שָׁ֑מֶשׁ ׳ בּ Josh 19:38 + 4 t.; — 1. city in southwest Judah Josh 15:10 ; 1Sam 6:9 ; 1Sam 6:12 (twice in verse); 1Sam 6:13 ; 1Sam 6:15 ; 1Sam 6:19 ; 1Sam 6:20 ; 1Kgs 4:9 ; 2Kgs 14:13 = 2Chr 25:23 ; 2Chr 28:18 distinguished from other places of same name as אֲשֶׁר לִיהוּדָה ׳ שׁ ׳ בּ 2Kgs 14:11 = 2Chr 25:21 assigned to Levites Josh 21:16 = 1Chr 6:44 — ruin at modern `Ain Shems Rob BR ii. 223 f. Bd Pal 163 Survey iii. 35, 60. 2. city in Naphtali Josh 19:38 ; Judg 1:33 (twice in verse) 3. city in Issachar Josh 19:22 possibly `Ain esh-Shemsîyeh , Jordan valley, south of Beisân (Beth Shean) Survey ii. 231. 4. = On-Heliopolis, in Egypt Jer 43:13 Rob BR i. 25 Eb GS 505 f. Dl Pa 318 f .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1091')\">BDB1091</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1053')\">H1053</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1090')\">BDB1090</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1092')\">BDB1092</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>בֵּית שֶׁ֫מֶשׁ</bdbheb> <b>proper name, of a location</b> (<highlight>sun-temple</highlight>) — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 19:22\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(6,19,22)\">Josh 19:22</ref> + 8 t., <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שֿׁ</bdbheb><bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 15:10\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(6,15,10)\">Josh 15:10</ref> + 6 t.; <bdbheb>שָׁ֑מֶשׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 19:38\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(6,19,38)\">Josh 19:38</ref> + 4 t.;