ref ref=\"1Chr 6:44\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(13,6,44)\">1Chr 6:44</ref> — ruin at modern <highlight>`Ain Shems</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Rob')\">Rob<sup>BR ii. 223 f.</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bäd')\">Bd<sup>Pal 163</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Survey')\">Survey<sup>iii. 35, 60.</sup></lookup> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> city in Naphtali <ref ref=\"Josh 19:38\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(6,19,38)\">Josh 19:38</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 1:33\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"33\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"33\" onclick=\"bcv(7,1,33)\">Judg 1:33</ref> (twice in verse) </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> city in Issachar <ref ref=\"Josh 19:22\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(6,19,22)\">Josh 19:22</ref> possibly <highlight>`Ain esh-Shemsîyeh</highlight>, Jordan valley, south of Beisân (Beth Shean) <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Survey')\">Survey<sup>ii. 231.</sup></lookup> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> = On-Heliopolis, in Egypt <ref ref=\"Jer 43:13\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(24,43,13)\">Jer 43:13</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Rob')\">Rob<sup>BR i. 25</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Eb')\">Eb<sup>GS 505 f.</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dl')\">Dl<sup>Pa 318 f</sup></lookup>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Josh 19:22", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 19, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Josh 15:10", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 15, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Josh 19:38", "book": "JOS", "chapter": 19, "verse": 38}, {"raw": "1Sam 6:9", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 6, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "1Sam 6:12", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 6, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "1Sam 6:13", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 6, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "1Sam 6:15", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 6, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "1Sam 6:19", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 6, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "1Sam 6: